+# Requirement accountability
+
+| Requirement | Actual outcome | Verification / remaining limit |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Continue available meaningful work | Specific purportedly missing call and following paragraph tested in two candidate copies, OC01/03/05 | Positive selected content in both; no native version/call authenticity or whole-call audit. |
+| Check existing sources/searches first | Telephone/steel last routes exhausted; unchanged technical outputs and compact owner states checked | No repeat carrier table/decoder/materials tests or failed custodian queries. Active chat is not a verified source-input job. |
+| Preserve conflicting records and source links | Note17, local Channel12 versus prior Channel2/DRM labels, A/Two wording, old time labels | No source repair, cause adjudication, preferred value or calculated offset. |
+| Test assumptions and contrary evidence | Candidate contains near-matching call and following conditional discussion | Broad omission inference qualified; exact-version/call/audibility objection remains. No independent-witness count. |
+| Exact scope/file/page/line/hash | COMPARISON-PINS, READING-SCOPE, SOURCES | Browser/viewer/internal/printed/Bates/reader conventions distinct. One clipped-image scope extension recorded before additional view. |
+| Preserve original representations | Five unchanged JPEGs native-only; hashes/readback | No native transcript PDF hash fabricated. Raw sources/full speech not public payload. |
+| Keep missing inputs as TODOs and full goal | Previous register copied with prior statuses/wording; AV-T02partial update; all18criteria retained | No goal completion or empirical/native test inferred from a preview. |
+| Revision accountability | New standalone derivative, actual TEXT-CHANGES.diff and retained-draft EDITORIAL-REVISION.diff | All earlier reports/public records unchanged; visual checks separate from text diffs. |
+| Publish eligible research as AveLyra | Reviewed additions only under existing authorization | Actual destination/account/commit identities/ref/all-file verification required before success claim; no empty commit, unrelated changes or private/raw payload. |
+| Periodic Overview handoff | Meaningful source result/publication may be sent under standing authorization | Only after publication verification; delivery not integration or acceptance. |
